{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45625","headline":"塞上曲二首 二 · 贯休","name":"塞上曲二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年转鬬阴山脚，生得单于却放却。\n今年深入于不毛，胡兵拔帐遗弓刀。\n男儿须展平生志，爲国输忠合天地。\n甲穿虽即失黄金，劒缺犹能生紫气。\n塞草萋萋兵士苦，胡虏如今勿胡虏。\n封侯十万始无心，玉关凯入君看取。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45625.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45625","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}